@startuml CodeLearnWay_RepondreAUneQuestion
title Sequence Diagram - Répondre à une question

actor Étudiant
participant Frontend
participant QuestionController
participant QuestionService
participant QuestionRepository
database Database

Étudiant -> Frontend : selectAnswer(questionId, answerId)
Frontend -> QuestionController : POST /questions/{id}/answer
QuestionController -> QuestionService : checkAnswer(questionId, answerId)

QuestionService -> QuestionRepository : findById(questionId)
QuestionRepository -> Database : Find question and answers
Database --> QuestionRepository : Question + Answers
QuestionRepository --> QuestionService : Question + Answers

QuestionService -> QuestionService : verifyAnswer(answerId)

alt Réponse correcte
    QuestionService --> QuestionController : Correct
    QuestionController --> Frontend : 200 OK + Correct
    Frontend --> Étudiant : displayCorrectFeedback()
else Réponse incorrecte
    QuestionService --> QuestionController : Incorrect
    QuestionController --> Frontend : 200 OK + Incorrect
    Frontend --> Étudiant : displayIncorrectFeedback()
end

@enduml